{"chunk_id": "7d9909fd4844", "text": "Ravana and Rama clash in a ferocious escalation of the great war. After Rama destroys one of his weapons, Ravana unleashes a succession of supernatural arms\u2014the Rudra and Solar weapons\u2014filling the sky with blazing discs and stormlike missiles. Rama counters each with divine skill, shattering them in midair. Lakshmana and Vibhishana join the fray, crippling Ravana\u2019s chariot, but the enraged titan hurls a terrible spear forged by Maya. Though Lakshmana bravely shields Vibhishana, the spear pierces his chest and fells him. Grief-stricken yet resolute, Rama breaks the embedded spear and vows before the monkey hosts that the war will end that day\u2014either Ravana or Rama will perish. Their renewed duel shakes the battlefield until Ravana, overwhelmed by Rama\u2019s storm of arrows, is forced to retreat.\nRama and Ravana unleash divine weapons; Lakshmana is struck down by Ravana\u2019s spear, prompting Rama\u2019s furious vow before Ravana briefly retreats.\nThemes: brotherly devotion, divine weapons in battle, Rama\u2019s wrath and resolve, heroic sacrifice, turning point in duel", "vector": [-0.007414022460579872, -0.022201700136065483, -0.0015070245135575533, 0.012022556737065315, -0.00229249382391572, 0.013731415383517742, -0.024448782205581665, -0.018084293231368065, -0.02514847181737423, -0.03188971430063248, 0.01866288296878338, 0.019873885437846184, 0.014760767109692097, 0.0070103551261126995, 0.004800276830792427, 0.014747311361134052, 0.037621788680553436, -0.02034483104944229, 0.03124384768307209, -0.02321086823940277, 0.00036035713856108487, -0.006122286897152662, -0.009445814415812492, 0.012015828862786293, -0.023035945370793343, 0.0006105467327870429, 0.020385198295116425, -0.03371967375278473, 0.018111204728484154, -0.0009292757022194564, -0.0008788172854110599, -0.0226457342505455, 0.005930545274168253, 0.001434700796380639, -0.019510585814714432, -0.002622155239805579, 0.002985455794259906, -0.0139937